  "scope": [
    "The final frontend and package reports bind the ordinary/module-qualified specialization lookup fix, and the embedded frontend identity matches current source and catalog inputs.",
    "Native Clang patches are unchanged from source 2.89; its 236 native unit tests and 412 compiler regressions were rerun. New publication/import behavior is implemented in the frontend facade.",
    "Source-free witnesses use the current GNU libstdc++ coroutine header. Header content is part of declaration identity; this does not qualify other standard-library implementations or general standard-library publication.",
    "Instrumented service and GNUstep runtime archives are reused unchanged from the combined sprint; reports bind actual binary, source and checker inputs.",
    "Three full-fixture executions are smoke configurations, not the complete full-fixture cross-product or SDK qualification. Earlier failed and intermediate package reports are retained separately."
  ],
  "remaining": [
    "Remaining dependent unnamed-type/lookup projections and unmodeled declaration attributes, calling conventions and allocator/format contracts",
    "Remaining ownership, structured concurrency, isolation, key-path, language/library, general standard-library and profile implementation",
    "Native Linux AArch64 implementation and qualification on a native host",
    "Coordinated post-2.62 SDK delivery"
  ]
